{% extends 'page.html.twig' %}

{% block content %}
    <twig:Panel>
        <p>Click to dynamically <code>import()</code> the confetti module. It ships as a separate chunk — open the Network tab and watch it load on the first click only.</p>
        <twig:Button class="mt-3" data-confetti="true">🎉 Load &amp; celebrate</twig:Button>
    </twig:Panel>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-500">In <code>entrypoints.json</code>, that chunk shows up under the entry's <code>dynamic</code> list. Lazy Stimulus controllers (Chart.js, Autocomplete, …) split the same way.</p>
{% endblock %}
